:: CharacterCreation {"position":"100,400","size":"100,100"}
<h2>CHARACTER CREATION</h2>
<p>Three voices inhabit the mind. Some speak louder than others.</p>
<div class="container-cards no-br">
    <div class="container-class">
        <h3>THE UNYIELDING</h3>
        <p>Adamant 4 / Noetarch 1 / Anamnesist 2</p>

        <<link "Choose the Unyielding" "Chapter01_Introduction">>
            <<run setup.applyCharacterPreset("adamant")>>
        <</link>>
    </div>

    <div class="container-class">
        <h3>THE SCHOLAR</h3>
        <p>Adamant 2 / Noetarch 4 / Anamnesist 1</p>

        <<link "Choose the Scholar" "Chapter01_Introduction">>
            <<run setup.applyCharacterPreset("noetarch")>>
        <</link>>
    </div>

    <div class="container-class">
        <h3>THE SEER</h3>
        <p>Adamant 1 / Noetarch 2 / Anamnesist 4</p>

        <<link "Choose the Seer" "Chapter01_Introduction">>
            <<run setup.applyCharacterPreset("anamnesist")>>
        <</link>>
    </div>
</div>
<hr>
[[Return to Main Menu->MainMenu]]


:: Chapter01_Introduction {"position":"300,200","size":"200,200"}
<h2>The Awakening</h2>
An inky blackness stretches beyond all measure. Boundless. Edgeless. No earth beneath you. No heavens above. Not even the mercy of a grave.

Here, there is no weight to carry. No ache of flesh. No name to answer to.

Yet there is an insistence. Faint, almost imperceptible. Something that ought to have a name. A face. A place among the living.

<div class="no-br" >

<<disciplinePrompt
    "adamant"
    "endurance"
    9
    "You are not gone. Not yet. But you brought us very close to the end."
    false
    ""
    "AwakeningAdamantRes_0"
    "I have done this to myself?"
>>


<<disciplinePrompt "noetarch" "analysis" 9 "You are reawakening. If we must draw a conclusion, we are lying on a mattress. Or fermenting inside a coffin. We have no more evidence to favor one over the other.">>

<<disciplinePrompt "anamnesist" "oneirology" 9 "A starless night sky. It is no ill omen, but we are astray. Elder one. You have given form to its absence...">>
</div>
A thoughtless impulse draws you towards it.
<<revealNext "Awakening_Body" "CONTINUE" "Awakening_Questions">>


:: Awakening_WhoSuccess {"position":"800,300","size":"100,100"}
<<run setup.addExperiencePoints(125)>>Across the darkness, a small crack of this shell-like world glances back at you. A spark of truth shines into the depths

You "were" change, the promise of tomorrow, a new dawn. It is gone now, you are whatever you wish to be...


:: Awakening_WhoFailure {"position":"800,200","size":"100,100"}
<<run setup.addExperiencePoints(125)>>The "truth" about your identity is missing. 

We found you here, floating on the inky blackness..., crumbling. Left to die. 

I can tell you who you are not: you are not someone loved.


:: Awakening_Questions {"position":"400,400","size":"100,100"}
<div class="no-br">
    <<redCheckPrompt "awakening.who_am_i" "Who am I?">>
    <<redCheckPrompt "awakening.what_am_i" "What am I?">>
</div>

<div id="awakening-white-slot">
    <<include "Awakening_WhiteUnlock">>
</div>


:: Awakening_Body {"position":"300,400","size":"100,100"}
Something stirs beyond the dark. An unfamiliar weight. The distant ache of flesh. Fingers, perhaps. A hand.

A heartbeat drums against the silence, indifferent to your arrival. Lungs draw breath without instruction. The machinery of life has carried on in your absence.


:: ContinueWidget [widget nobr] {"position":"300,0","size":"100,100"}
<<widget "skills">>
    <<set _disciplineId = _args[0]>>
    <<set _skillId = _args[1]>>

    <<set _skill = setup.disciplines[_disciplineId].skills[_skillId]>>
    <<set _value = $character.disciplines[_disciplineId].skills[_skillId]>>
    <<set _pending = setup.getSkillDraft(_disciplineId, _skillId)>>

    <div class="ui-skill">
        <div class="skill-header">
            <strong><<= _skill.name>>:</strong>

            <span class="skill-value">
                <<= _value + _pending>>
                <<if _pending > 0>>
                    <small>(+<<= _pending>> pending)</small>
                <</if>>
            </span>

            <<capture _disciplineId _skillId>>
                <<if setup.getSkillDraft(_disciplineId, _skillId) > 0>>
                    <<link "−">>
                        <<run setup.stageSkillUpgrade(_disciplineId, _skillId, -1)>>
                        <<replace "#skills-panel-content">>
                            <<include "UI_SkillsBody">>
                        <</replace>>
                    <</link>>
                <</if>>

                <<if setup.getRemainingSkillPoints() > 0>>
                    <<link "+">>
                        <<run setup.stageSkillUpgrade(_disciplineId, _skillId, 1)>>
                        <<replace "#skills-panel-content">>
                            <<include "UI_SkillsBody">>
                        <</replace>>
                    <</link>>
                <</if>>
            <</capture>>
        </div>

        <p class="skill-description">
            <<= _skill.description>>
        </p>
    </div>
<</widget>>



<<widget "revealNext">>
    <<set _includeId = _args[0]>>
    <<set _label = _args[1] || "CONTINUE" >>
    <<set _nextInclude = _args.length > 2 ? _args[2] : null>>

    <<capture _includeId _label _nextInclude>>
        <div class="narrative-continue">
            <<linkreplace _label>>
                <div class="narrative-section">
                    <<include _includeId>>
                </div>

                <<if _nextInclude>>
                    <<revealNext _nextInclude>>
                <</if>>
            <</linkreplace>>
        </div>
    <</capture>>
<</widget>>


:: RedChecks [widget nobr] {"position":"400,0","size":"100,100"}
<<widget "redCheckPrompt">>
    <<set _checkId = _args[0]>>
    <<set _label = _args[1]>>
    <<set _check = setup.activeChecks[_checkId]>>
    <<set _skillName = setup.disciplines[_check.discipline].skills[_check.skill].name>>

    <<capture _checkId _label _skillName>>
        <<if $checks[_checkId]>>
            <<redCheckResult _checkId>>
        <<else>>
            <div class="red-check-prompt">
                <div class="check-prompt-header">
                    <span><<= _skillName>> · RED CHECK</span>
                    <span>ONE ATTEMPT</span>
                </div>

               
<<linkreplace _label>>
    <<run setup.resolveActiveCheck(_checkId)>>

    <<redCheckResult _checkId>>

    <<replace "#awakening-white-slot">>
        <<include "Awakening_WhiteUnlock">>
    <</replace>>
<</linkreplace>>

            </div>
        <</if>>
    <</capture>>
<</widget>>


<<widget "redCheckResult">>
    <<set _checkId = _args[0]>>
    <<set _check = setup.activeChecks[_checkId]>>
    <<set _result = $checks[_checkId]>>
    
    

    <<if _check && _result>>
        <<set _outcomePassage = _result.success
            ? _check.successPassage
            : _check.failurePassage>>

        <div @class="'active-check-result ' + _check.discipline">
            <div class="check-header">
                <strong>
                    <<= setup.disciplines[_check.discipline].skills[_check.skill].name>>
                </strong>

                <span @class="_result.success ? 'check-success' : 'check-failure'">
                    <<= _result.success ? "SUCCESS" : "FAILURE">>
                </span>
            </div>

            <div class="check-dice">
                <span class="check-die"><<= _result.dice[0]>></span>
                <span class="check-die"><<= _result.dice[1]>></span>

                <span class="check-modifier">
                    + <<= _result.discipline + _result.skill>>
                </span>
            </div>

            <div class="check-total">
                <<= _result.total>> / <<= _result.threshold>>
            </div>

            <div class="check-narrative">
                <<include _outcomePassage>>
            </div>
        </div>
    <</if>>
<</widget>>


