:: Awakening_Analyze_Success {"position":"1100,300","size":"100,100"}
The fragments arrange themselves into something resembling a memory.

You begin to understand that your awakening was not an accident.


:: Awakening_Analyze_Failure {"position":"1100,500","size":"100,100"}
